---
---

<footer class="bg-black border-t border-neutral-900">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-10">

      <div>
        <a href="/" class="font-serif text-xl font-bold italic text-neutral-600 no-underline">
          Wear<span class="text-red-700 not-italic">Lab</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed max-w-48">
          El primer marketplace de moda con visualización 3D en tiempo real. Hecho en Colombia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-600 mb-4">Tienda</div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <a href="/catalogo"    class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 hover:text-red-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-200">Catálogo</a>
          <a href="/diseñadores" class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 hover:text-red-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-200">Diseñadores</a>
          <a href="/nosotros"    class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 hover:text-red-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-200">Nosotros</a>
          <a href="/auth/login"  class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 hover:text-red-700 no-underline transition-colors duration-200">Iniciar sesión</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-600 mb-4">¿Tienes una marca?</div>
        <p class="text-xs font-light text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Abre tu mini-tienda en WearLab y vende tus diseños con visualización 3D.
        </p>
        <a href="/auth/register" class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase bg-red-700 hover:bg-red-600 text-white px-4 py-2 no-underline transition-colors duration-200">
          Ser diseñador →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-neutral-900 pt-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-xs text-neutral-700 tracking-wide">
        © 2026 WearLab · Bogotá, Colombia · Hackathon CubePath × midudev
      </span>
      <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 px-2 py-1">Unity 6</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 px-2 py-1">Astro JS</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 px-2 py-1">Node.js</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 px-2 py-1">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-neutral-800 border border-neutral-900 px-2 py-1">MongoDB</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>